+ description: "🧠 Multi-layer memory system: fresh + mesh edges + fuzzy search + auto-summarize + compliance"
+ Multi-layer memory system for LLM agents. Fresh daily layer, mesh graph with edges, auto-logging, fuzzy search, auto-summarize, and compliance checks.
+ ```bash
+ mem-bridge init           # Rotate fresh layer
+ mem-bridge summarize      # Auto-generate recap from yesterday's logs
+ auto_log "msg" "reply"    # Log interaction
+ memory_search "query"     # Search all layers + fuzzy + edges
+ memcheck                  # Full 10-point compliance
+ ```
+ ## End-to-End
+ # Session start
+ mem-bridge init
+ mem-bridge summarize
+ auto_log "start" "ready"
+ # During session
+ auto_log "user query" "response"
+ memory_search "past topic"
+ # Session end
+ mem-bridge checkpoint
